      "machineHash": "797f54576321345ad3ab0cf563a4806525fc88817571bbfd164525e53da438ab",
      "machineText": "*`frontend/dist/`是最终随应用分发的内容。*`main.go`使用`//go:embed all:frontend/dist`嵌入构建后的前端，并通过资源服务器提供这些内容。构建必须将静态包输出到`frontend/dist/`（Vite 的默认输出目录）。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*`frontend/dist/` is what ships.* `main.go` embeds the built frontend with `//go:embed all:frontend/…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
